{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kGMpoRieQW1794636034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警察學院舉行結業會操。</p><p></p><p>新一批13名見習督察及130名學警，以步操進場。保安局副局長卓孝業任檢閱官。他致辭時提及過去37年警隊生涯，不論面對90年代的悍匪或是近年的暴亂，警隊一直盡忠職守、毫不退縮，雖然目前看來歲月靜好，但仍要居安思危。</p><p></p><p>他提醒畢業警務人員不論當值或休班，都要撫心自問自己的言行，亦要以人為本，緊記每名受害人、證人都是有血有肉，不要麻木處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:13.156675+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:19:36.139007+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:31.128720+00:00","content_hash":"dbcf73ff4b97f1a6a08508b137a61b99a69025ee98bc6ca9bc30cac7b979aea4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:13.156675+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}